                    "# Advanced Features and Model Deployment\n",
                    "## Overview\n",
                    "**Production deployment and advanced features for live Treasury Analytics systems**\n",
                    "\n",
                    "## Introduction\n",
                    "This notebook provides comprehensive coverage of Advanced Features and Model Deployment techniques for Treasury Analytics. It focuses on deploying production-ready machine learning models, implementing automated deployment pipelines, and managing live Treasury Analytics systems for real-world applications.\n",
                    "\n",
                    "### Learning Objectives:\n",
                    "- Master model deployment strategies for treasury analytics\n",
                    "- Implement automated deployment pipelines\n",
                    "- Develop production monitoring and alerting systems\n",
                    "- Create model versioning and rollback capabilities\n",
                    "- Build comprehensive deployment dashboards\n",
                    "\n",
                    "### Prerequisites:\n",
                    "- Understanding of machine learning model deployment\n",
                    "- Knowledge of containerization and cloud deployment\n",
                    "- Familiarity with CI/CD pipeline concepts\n",
                    "\n",
                    "### Step-by-Step Instructions:\n",
                    "1. Set up deployment environment and infrastructure\n",
                    "2. Prepare models for production deployment\n",
                    "3. Implement containerization and deployment strategies\n",
                    "4. Create monitoring and alerting systems\n",
                    "5. Build deployment dashboards and reporting\n",
                    "6. Implement automated testing and validation\n",
                    "\n",
                    "### Key Features:\n",
                    "- ✅ Model deployment strategies\n",
                    "- ✅ Containerization and orchestration\n",
                    "- ✅ Production monitoring systems\n",
                    "- ✅ Automated deployment pipelines\n",
                    "- ✅ Model versioning and rollback\n",
                    "- ✅ Attribution support\n"
                ]
            },
            {
                "cell_type": "code",
                "execution_count": None,
                "metadata": {},
                "outputs": [],
                "source": [
                    "import pandas as pd\n",
                    "import numpy as np\n",
                    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
                    "import seaborn as sns\n",
                    "import json
",
 "import os
",
 "import subprocess
",
 "from datetime import datetime
",
 "\n",
 "print('🚀 Treasury Analytics Notebook: Advanced Features and Model Deployment')\n",
 "print('✅ Environment ready for production deployment\n')\n",
 "\n",
 "# Generate treasury analytics data for model deployment demonstration\n",
 "np.random.seed(42)\n",
 "\n",
 "def generate_deployment_data(n_samples=365):\n",
 "    dates = pd.date_range('2024-01-01', periods=n_samples, freq='D')\n",
 "    \n",
 "    # Generate various treasury metrics\n",
 "    cash_flow = np.random.lognormal(8, 1.5, n_samples)\n",
 "    portfolio_value = 1000000 + np.cumsum(np.random.lognormal(0.5, 2, n_samples))\n",
 "    risk_score = np.random.beta(1, 3, n_samples)\n",
 "    liquidity_ratio = np.random.beta(2, 1, n_samples)\n",
 "    compliance_score = np.random.beta(2, 1, n_samples)\n",
 "    \n",
 "    deployment_data = {
",
 "        'date': dates,\n",
 "        'cash_flow': cash_flow,\n",
 "        'portfolio_value': portfolio_value,\n",
 "        'risk_score': risk_score,\n",
 "        'liquidity_ratio': liquidity_ratio,\n",
 "        'compliance_score': compliance_score,\n",
 "        'model_version': np.random.choice(['v1.0', 'v2.0', 'v3.0'], n_samples, p=[0.3, 0.5, 0.2]),\n",
 "        'deployment_status': np.random.choice(['active', 'testing', 'deprecated'], n_samples, p=[0.7, 0.2, 0.1]),\n",
 "        'performance_score': np.random.beta(2, 1, n_samples)\n",
 "    }
",
 "    return pd.DataFrame(deployment_data)\n",
 "\n",
 "df = generate_deployment_data(180)\n",
 "\n",
 "print('📊 Deployment Model Data Overview:')\n",
 "print(f\"Date range: {df['date'].min()} to {df['date'].max()}\")\n",
 "print(f\"Total records: {len(df):,}\")\n",
 "print(f\"Active models: {df[df['deployment_status'] == 'active']['model_version'].nunique()}\")\n",
 "print(f\"Model versions: {df['model_version'].unique()}\")\n",
 "print(f\"Average performance score: {df['performance_score'].mean():.3f}\\n')\n",
 "\n",
 "print('🔍 Data Structure:')\n",
 "print(df.head(3))\n"
                ]
            },
            {
                "cell_type": "code",
                "execution_count": None,
                "metadata": {},
                "outputs": [],
                "source": [
                    "# Model Deployment and Production Analysis Section\n",
 "print('🔬 Model Deployment and Production Analysis:')\n",
 "\n",
 "# Model deployment analysis\n",
 "print('🚀 Model Deployment Analysis:')\n",
 "\n",
 "# Analyze model performance by version\n",
 "model_performance = df.groupby('model_version').agg({
",
 "    'performance_score': ['mean', 'std', 'count'],
",
 "    'deployment_status': lambda x: (x == 'active').sum()
",
 "}).round(3)\n",
 "\n",
 "print('Model Performance Overview:')
",
 "print(model_performance)\n",
 "\n",
 "# Deployment status analysis\n",
 "deployment_analysis = df['deployment_status'].value_counts().to_dict()
",
 "print(f\"Deployment Status: {deployment_analysis}\")\n",
 "\n",
 "# Calculate deployment readiness scores\n",
 "df['deployment_readiness'] = (
",
 "    df['performance_score'] * 0.4 + 
",
 "    df['compliance_score'] * 0.3 + 
",
 "    df['liquidity_ratio'] * 0.3
",
 ")\n",
 "\n",
 "# Identify models ready for production\n",
 "ready_models = df[df['deployment_readiness'] > 0.7]\n",
 "print(f\"Models ready for production: {len(ready_models)}")\n",
 "\n",
 "# Create deployment dashboard metrics\n",
 "print('📊 Deployment Dashboard Metrics:')
",
 "total_models = df['model_version'].nunique()
",
 "active_models = deployment_analysis.get('active', 0)
",
 "testing_models = deployment_analysis.get('testing', 0)
",
 "deprecated_models = deployment_analysis.get('deprecated', 0)
",
 "avg_performance = df['performance_score'].mean()
",
 "\n",
 "print(f\"  📈 Total Models: {total_models}\")
",
 "print(f\"  ✅ Active Models: {active_models}\")
",
 "print(f\"  🧪 Testing Models: {testing_models}\")
",
 "print(f\"  ❌ Deprecated Models: {deprecated_models}\")
",
 "print(f\"  🎯 Average Performance Score: {avg_performance:.3f}\\n')\n",
 "\n",
 "# Create deployment visualization\n",
 "plt.figure(figsize=(15, 10))\n",
 "\n",
 "plt.subplot(2, 2, 1)\n",
 "model_perf = df.groupby('model_version')['performance_score'].mean()
",
 "model_perf.plot(kind='bar', color='skyblue', alpha=0.7)
",
 "plt.title('Model Performance by Version')
",
 "plt.ylabel('Performance Score')
",
 "plt.xlabel('Model Version')
",
 "\n",
 "plt.subplot(2, 2, 2)\n",
 "deployment_counts = df['deployment_status'].value_counts()
",
 "deployment_counts.plot(kind='pie', autopct='%1.1f%%', colors=['#2ecc71', '#f39c12', '#e74c3c'])
",
 "plt.title('Deployment Status Distribution')
",
 "\n",
 "plt.subplot(2, 2, 3)\n",
 "df['date'] = pd.to_datetime(df['date'])
",
 "rolling_readiness = df['deployment_readiness'].rolling(window=30).mean()
",
 "plt.plot(df['date'], rolling_readiness, color='green', linewidth=2)
",
 "plt.title('Deployment Readiness (30-day Rolling Average)')
",
 "plt.xlabel('Date')
",
 "plt.ylabel('Readiness Score')
",
 "plt.xticks(rotation=45)
",
 "\n",
 "plt.subplot(2, 2, 4)\n",
 "correlation_matrix = df[['performance_score', 'compliance_score', 'liquidity_ratio', 'risk_score']].corr()
",
 "sns.heatmap(correlation_matrix, annot=True, cmap='coolwarm', center=0)
",
 "plt.title('Model Performance Correlations')
",
 "\n",
 "plt.tight_layout()
",
 "plt.show()
",
 "\n",
 "print('🎯 Model Deployment Analysis Complete!')\n"
                ]
            }
